> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":54,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":4192,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1880882,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1419189907,"LastPoster":{"Id":279694,"Name":"rbehlke","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279694.jpg?_r=1425843817","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":44,"Preview":{"Id":1881194,"PostDate":1419819691,"PostContent":"@misbosox will your bridal parties gift be their OOT bags or will you be giving them something el...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398815231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f063b3989c6704cf15b14a855073f932","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mrsktobe\" post=\"1881028\" timestamp=\"1419350020\"]\nShe&#039;s right, I got the 20 oz ones. and LOL I ended up bringing 44 down hahaha. I was that person. We got Option plus, plus spread them out between a few of our friends. I also bubble wrapped all of them with bubble wrap from home depot. Because I got so many of them, there was a discount - I think it was 15-20% off bulk orders. I liked ordering off the website as there were various colors to choose from. And the customer service was awesome. We ended up receiving 3 broken ones and they shipped out new ones, no problem the next day.[\/quote]I never would have thought bubba&#039;s could break. Eek now I&#039;m worried for my tumblers. I&#039;m not bubble wrapping each individually as no room but I&#039;ve used a lot of bubble wrap and cardboard in the suitcase. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1881033,"PostDate":1419339550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mrsktobe, on 23 December 2014 - 11:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>She's right, I got the 20 oz ones. and LOL I ended up bringing 44 down hahaha. I was that person. We got Option plus, plus spread them out between a few of our friends. I also bubble wrapped all of them with bubble wrap from home depot. Because I got so many of them, there was a discount - I think it was 15-20% off bulk orders. I liked ordering off the website as there were various colors to choose from. And the customer service was awesome. We ended up receiving 3 broken ones and they shipped out new ones, no problem the next day.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI never would have thought bubba's could break. Eek now I'm worried for my tumblers. I'm not bubble wrapping each individually as no room but I've used a lot of bubble wrap and cardboard in the suitcase. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.212.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b47bee4043b4cb4443128e67ccddd0f3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1881033\" timestamp=\"1419353950\"]\nI never would have thought bubba&#039;s could break. Eek now I&#039;m worried for my tumblers. I&#039;m not bubble wrapping each individually as no room but I&#039;ve used a lot of bubble wrap and cardboard in the suitcase.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]You should be ok. It was only a few of them and it was close to the handle - sometimes stuff happens like that in shipping, but it was done by the UPS, not me. All should be good.\n\nHow excited are you?? It&#039;s coming fast!","Attachments":[],"Id":1881034,"PostDate":1419339766,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-time=\"1419353950\" data-cid=\"1881033\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\"><p>I never would have thought bubba's could break. Eek now I'm worried for my tumblers. I'm not bubble wrapping each individually as no room but I've used a lot of bubble wrap and cardboard in the suitcase.<br><br><br>Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/blockquote><br>You should be ok. It was only a few of them and it was close to the handle - sometimes stuff happens like that in shipping, but it was done by the UPS, not me. All should be good.<br><br>How excited are you?? It's coming fast!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304957891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4296d0e0c1558f9e8f200bf924aa1e62","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mrsktobe\" post=\"1881034\" timestamp=\"1419354166\"]\nYou should be ok. It was only a few of them and it was close to the handle - sometimes stuff happens like that in shipping, but it was done by the UPS, not me. All should be good.\n\nHow excited are you?? It&#039;s coming fast![\/quote]Excited but annoyed. Communication was supposed to be faster once we get our personal WC and it&#039;s worse :( over a week to respond. Not sure what to do???  I heard a rumor I got a new one :(\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1881040,"PostDate":1419341538,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mrsktobe, on 23 December 2014 - 01:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>You should be ok. It was only a few of them and it was close to the handle - sometimes stuff happens like that in shipping, but it was done by the UPS, not me. All should be good.<br><br>\nHow excited are you?? It's coming fast!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nExcited but annoyed. Communication was supposed to be faster once we get our personal WC and it's worse <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> over a week to respond. Not sure what to do???  I heard a rumor I got a new one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.212.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f49756d04e83c9673e098a1b449df12d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1881040\" timestamp=\"1419355938\"]\nExcited but annoyed. Communication was supposed to be faster once we get our personal WC and it&#039;s worse :( over a week to respond. Not sure what to do??? I heard a rumor I got a new one :(\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]That&#039;s annoying. I would lose my sh*t if It was a week and I hadn&#039;t heard from my wedding coordinator. But I know from reading a lot on this forums, that&#039;s normal for the one&#039;s who work on the resort? Though one would think as you get closer, it would be better communication.\n\nI checked out your planning thread and wow!! Looks amazing. I can&#039;t wait to see pictures of how it all turned out :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1881044,"PostDate":1419341837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-time=\"1419355938\" data-cid=\"1881040\" data-author=\"calgarybride2015\"><p>Excited but annoyed. Communication was supposed to be faster once we get our personal WC and it's worse <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> over a week to respond. Not sure what to do??? I heard a rumor I got a new one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br><br>Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/blockquote><br>That's annoying. I would lose my sh*t if It was a week and I hadn't heard from my wedding coordinator. But I know from reading a lot on this forums, that's normal for the one's who work on the resort? Though one would think as you get closer, it would be better communication.<br><br>I checked out your planning thread and wow!! Looks amazing. I can't wait to see pictures of how it all turned out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304957891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"660eaf84e9cb731767fcea03c53b1c1f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mrsktobe\" post=\"1881044\" timestamp=\"1419356237\"]\nThat&#039;s annoying. I would lose my sh*t if It was a week and I hadn&#039;t heard from my wedding coordinator. But I know from reading a lot on this forums, that&#039;s normal for the one&#039;s who work on the resort? Though one would think as you get closer, it would be better communication.\n\nI checked out your planning thread and wow!! Looks amazing. I can&#039;t wait to see pictures of how it all turned out :)[\/quote]They are on site.  I thought it got better but my experience is worse. And I have a feeling it&#039;s this certain coordinator. Debating emailing again or calling. \n\nThanks :) just finishing up some last stuff and will post it.  \n\nLegal booked for jan 10 :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1881047,"PostDate":1419344808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mrsktobe, on 23 December 2014 - 01:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>That's annoying. I would lose my sh*t if It was a week and I hadn't heard from my wedding coordinator. But I know from reading a lot on this forums, that's normal for the one's who work on the resort? Though one would think as you get closer, it would be better communication.<br><br>\nI checked out your planning thread and wow!! Looks amazing. I can't wait to see pictures of how it all turned out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThey are on site.  I thought it got better but my experience is worse. And I have a feeling it's this certain coordinator. Debating emailing again or calling. <br><br>\nThanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> just finishing up some last stuff and will post it.  <br><br>\nLegal booked for jan 10 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.108.35.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e77afd3b61bf735b9763645d3e62f579","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kimmyd2\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We were going to go to the underwater museum but the weather was bad. I think we went ended up snorkeling off the island of Isla Mujeres. It was beautiful even though it wasn&#039;t our original plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881056,"PostDate":1419350874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280238\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280238-kimmyd2\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kimmyd2<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We were going to go to the underwater museum but the weather was bad. I think we went ended up snorkeling off the island of Isla Mujeres. It was beautiful even though it wasn't our original plan.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackielemman86@comcast.net","IpAddress":"70.123.142.233","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379785198,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273651.jpg?_r=1388803183","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackielemman","Id":273651,"Name":"jackielemman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.193.33.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d99af4c7248276a2850fb2da7760699","RawContent":"Hi MrsKtobe\n\nThanks so much for the heads up on bagiva! I was wondering where you got the bag printed?","Attachments":[],"Id":1881149,"PostDate":1419730272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi MrsKtobe<br>\nThanks so much for the heads up on bagiva! I was wondering where you got the bag printed?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliedps@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"216.58.64.57","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1376414744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272558.jpg?_r=1403105328","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hapykat","Id":272558,"Name":"hapykat","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.5.214","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a2d0f0f092a1a2dab3454d744eb7114","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have personally brought a Bubba with me all 4 times we stayed at an All Inclusive and it was the best thing I packed! However, we&#039;re looking like we are going to have 70-80 guests, so that is just not feasible! On the pre-trip information we send people I will suggest they bring one.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I do plan to do a room key\/tip holder on a wrist coil for our guests - primarily because I always wish I had something to keep my tip money dry in the pool\/beach but it will also help our guests identify other guests that are part of our wedding group (those they don&#039;t already know) when they run into each other. That *may* be the only favor we do, but we are hooking up transportation for some excursions and looking into a catamaran or sunset cruise for our guests as well. I agree with all the other posters that no one is going to have expectations or be disappointed if they don&#039;t get an OOT bag!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881158,"PostDate":1419776908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have personally brought a Bubba with me all 4 times we stayed at an All Inclusive and it was the best thing I packed! However, we're looking like we are going to have 70-80 guests, so that is just not feasible! On the pre-trip information we send people I will suggest they bring one.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I do plan to do a room key\/tip holder on a wrist coil for our guests - primarily because I always wish I had something to keep my tip money dry in the pool\/beach but it will also help our guests identify other guests that are part of our wedding group (those they don't already know) when they run into each other. That *may* be the only favor we do, but we are hooking up transportation for some excursions and looking into a catamaran or sunset cruise for our guests as well. I agree with all the other posters that no one is going to have expectations or be disappointed if they don't get an OOT bag!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"519175d75696d72528ff295464b6032d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;we are only doing them for our bridesmaids and groomsmen.&amp;nbsp; Not much in them, just beach bag, hangover kit, maybe sunglasses, beach ball, etc.   Other wise we are not doing them for the regular guests.&amp;nbsp; We have too many people and trying to save money.&amp;nbsp; instead we are getting maracas as favors for our wedding..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881171,"PostDate":1419795710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>we are only doing them for our bridesmaids and groomsmen.\u00a0 Not much in them, just beach bag, hangover kit, maybe sunglasses, beach ball, etc.\u00a0\u00a0 Other wise we are not doing them for the regular guests.\u00a0 We have too many people and trying to save money.\u00a0 instead we are getting maracas as favors for our wedding..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383038867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.17.81.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78500,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb307ab61b79509f6260475b989f96aa","RawContent":"@[member=\"misbosox\"] will your bridal parties gift be their OOT bags or will you be giving them something else as well?","Attachments":[],"Id":1881194,"PostDate":1419819691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274657\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274657-misbosox\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">misbosox<\/span><\/a> will your bridal parties gift be their OOT bags or will you be giving them something else as well?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398815231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78500","Title":"Not Doing Oot Bags?","LastPostDate":1440424146},"Pages":{"TotalItems":54,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
