              font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jacq<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I also thought of nice personalized hot pink\/ fuchsia satin robes (my wedding color!) for all my girls but cant find any online that I like... any ideas?? I thought it would also make a cute photo op <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I am also looking for Fuschia Satin Robes, did you find them yet?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Holly.Charles@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333570973,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253621.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":260,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HollyAndJohn","Id":253621,"Name":"HollyAndJohn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22794e5e6e5187c8dffb4c79c3496ce5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; This is probably too late for you Holly but maybe someone else may want to know...here are affordable fuschia robes. They ship pretty quickly from what I&#039;ve heard too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1697576,"PostDate":1356275606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is probably too late for you Holly but maybe someone else may want to know...here are affordable fuschia robes. They ship pretty quickly from what I've heard too.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nataliemcd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.83.84.72","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338777721,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256221.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nattie03","Id":256221,"Name":"nattie03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45947f7ae3a2fcac78065aba430a63ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have paid for their dresses $160 each and will pay for them to get their hair done at Suzanne Morel on the day of which is about $100 each. I&#039;d love to get them robes but I already went over budget on their dresses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1697604,"PostDate":1356290280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, V