{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9873220cccc27fc65504131d06a64eb","RawContent":"good job!!!! did you make the template for the stickers? what print\/graphics shop did you go to if you dont mind sharing?? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sillafeliz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n They&#039;re done!! They look awesome! For $25 you can&#039;t go wrong! We didn&#039;t even have to put the stickers on! One less thing we have to do! :) It&#039;s not so DIY but our original plan didn&#039;t work so well... So , if you want to do these, get the cups from your local dollarama and take them to a local sign\/graphics company and see what they would charge - you&#039;d be surprised!\n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/195719\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1739491,"PostDate":1364467694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> good job!!!! did you make the template for the stickers? what print\/graphics shop did you go to if you dont mind sharing??<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sillafeliz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> They're done!! They look awesome! For $25 you can't go wrong! We didn't even have to put the stickers on! One less thing we have to do! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It's not so DIY but our original plan didn't work so well... So , if you want to do these, get the cups from your local dollarama and take them to a local sign\/graphics company and see what they would charge - you'd be surprised!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"195719\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/195719\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latina_jenn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.24","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359022290,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265001.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenn963","Id":265001,"Name":"Jenn963","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2b37ddfa71883f9a375a4ed45a8efbf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks so much ladies! :) I&#039;m really happy with them. After being so disappointed with the DIY stickers that we printed ourselves - this is a great solution!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Soooo we just used a place in Barrie, Ontario - Fast Signs...just a local shop. We got 22 cups done for us and they gave us the 8 extra stickers that were printed out. We didn&#039;t actually tell them a size - apparently they just used the size of the picture I sent them. LOL :) My FI told them to use their judgement - stickers are 3\" x 3\". I&#039;d say they are a perfect size! :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I used Powerpoint to create the logo myself - obviously using ideas from another bride on this site!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The total bill was no more than $30 for everything done for us. There was a minimum of 25...which was fine - I&#039;m good to have the extra stickers. Maybe I&#039;ll put them on a bubba ;) lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1739775,"PostDate":1364507043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much ladies! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm really happy with them. After being so disappointed with the DIY stickers that we printed ourselves - this is a great solution!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Soooo we just used a place in Barrie, Ontario - Fast Signs...just a local shop. We got 22 cups done for us and they gave us the 8 extra stickers that were printed out. We didn't actually tell them a size - apparently they just used the size of the picture I sent them. LOL <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> My FI told them to use their judgement - stickers are 3\" x 3\". I'd say they are a perfect size! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I used Powerpoint to create the logo myself - obviously using ideas from another bride on this site!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The total bill was no more than $30 for everything done for us. There was a minimum of 25...which was fine - I'm good to have the extra stickers. Maybe I'll put them on a bubba <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silla.feliz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334781041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sillafeliz","Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1ecb317855098446e377d7cc6fc3634","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh, and the stickers are printed on a clear plastic adhesive sticker...so they are completely see-through and waterproof. I don&#039;t know that you can buy this stuff somewhere and print yourself..I doubt it. Its the same kind of stickers that they put stickers or pin striping on a car with....so very heavy duty. Definitely NOT going to come off. :)\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1739780,"PostDate":1364507317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh, and the stickers are printed on a clear plastic adhesive sticker...so they are completely see-through and waterproof. I don't know that you can buy this stuff somewhere and print yourself..I doubt it. Its the same kind of stickers that they put stickers or pin striping on a car with....so very heavy duty. Definitely NOT going to come off. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silla.feliz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334781041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254217.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sillafeliz","Id":254217,"Name":"sillafeliz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"977698e45b81a25be3a7cb00cd6748aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; what a great idea! i will be doing thist&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1739815,"PostDate":1364509211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> what a great idea! i will be doing thist<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kefritz21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1364506581,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kefritz","Id":267926,"Name":"kefritz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b9160db7f2b0615e73d8db90fcda0ea","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]sillafeliz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Oh, and the stickers are printed on a clear plastic adhesive sticker...so they are completely see-through and waterproof. I don&#039;t know that you can buy this stuff somewhere and print yourself..I doubt it. Its the same kind of stickers that they put stickers or pin striping on a car with....so very heavy duty. Definitely NOT going to come off. :)\n[\/quote] \n love that they won&#039;t come off.. a bigger reason for me to do these \n \n \n just don&#039;t know if it&#039;s worth it for my to lug them to Hawaii., it&#039;s not like our resort is all inclusive.. so really what is it for? so then i thought koozies, just hoping that they fit the cups that the pool gives? then i&#039;m like, i don&#039;t think you can bring your own down to the pool, so is that worth it? but they&#039;re so cute!! &amp;amp; the koozies are pretty cheap! \n \n any suggestions or opinions?!","Attachments":[],"Id":1739829,"PostDate":1364510354,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>sillafeliz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Oh, and the stickers are printed on a clear plastic adhesive sticker...so they are completely see-through and waterproof. I don't know that you can buy this stuff somewhere and print yourself..I doubt it. Its the same kind of stickers that they put stickers or pin striping on a car with....so very heavy duty. Definitely NOT going to come off. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> love that they won't come off.. a bigger reason for me to do these<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> just don't know if it's worth it for my to lug them to Hawaii., it's not like our resort is all inclusive.. so really what is it for? so then i thought koozies, just hoping that they fit the cups that the pool gives? then i'm like, i don't think you can bring your own down to the pool, so is that worth it? but they're so cute!! & the koozies are pretty cheap!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> any suggestions or opinions?!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aleedoc17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361649075,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"aleedoc17","Id":266489,"Name":"aleedoc17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfa476a6fb9635ec56663fe649cadf17","RawContent":"Where did u purchase these plain like that? Love how urs turned out so adorable!","Attachments":[],"Id":1739923,"PostDate":1364540723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Where did u purchase these plain like that? Love how urs turned out so adorable!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"July2014bride@verizon.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1358966735,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264966.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MK71809","Id":264966,"Name":"MK71809","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0479a376f80887adf3e1e19476cabed","RawContent":"Have you both tested these to see if try held up with water?","Attachments":[],"Id":1740012,"PostDate":1364559692,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Have you both tested these to see if try held up with water?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mvee1025@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.177.132.210","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359850900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265570.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mvee1025","Id":265570,"Name":"mvee1025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb45ef9ee6a0b9467c43e1bf96e65cd3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black;\"&gt;I LOVE how these turned out Jamie!&amp;nbsp; And I like that the sticker is clear.&amp;nbsp; It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s always a great feeling when a project isn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t working out how you expected and then it turns out amazing.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1740034,"PostDate":1364562521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I LOVE how these turned out Jamie!\u00a0 And I like that the sticker is clear.\u00a0 It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s always a great feeling when a project isn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t working out how you expected and then it turns out amazing.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samcleod23@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.136.150.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340887835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257242.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SamIAm85","Id":257242,"Name":"SamIAm85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73219,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bc4936084f6dc06374c7a49f43cf30d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black;\"&gt;I tested the stickers I ordered from Davet Designs, and they really are waterproof.&amp;nbsp; I hand washed them twice and I let them soak in water.&amp;nbsp; They are not coming off!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black;\"&gt;I purchased&amp;nbsp;my tumblers from the Dollar Tree. The colors I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen in store are Clear, Blue, Red, Orange, Green and Pink. I had to go to at least 3 stores to get all clear cups, and I had them checking to see if they had any more in stock in the back.&amp;nbsp; I&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black;\"&gt;f you don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind assorted colors, you can order them off their website.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1740037,"PostDate":1364562693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I tested the stickers I ordered from Davet Designs, and they really are waterproof.\u00a0 I hand washed them twice and I let them soak in water.\u00a0 They are not coming off!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">I purchased\u00a0my tumblers from the Dollar Tree. The colors I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen in store are Clear, Blue, Red, Orange, Green and Pink. I had to go to at least 3 stores to get all clear cups, and I had them checking to see if they had any more in stock in the back.\u00a0 I<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: black\">f you don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind assorted colors, you can order them off their website.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">http:\/\/www.dollartree.com\/household\/kitchen-dining\/drinkware\/Double-Wall-Plastic-Tumblers-with-Straws-16-oz-\/756c726c727p329779\/index.pro?method=search<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samcleod23@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.136.150.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1340887835,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257242.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SamIAm85","Id":257242,"Name":"SamIAm85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":fals