Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7c2f8fd1f1c16176d2b23a7f03f6df9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1893426\" timestamp=\"1429232600\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] Who was the photographer you used with Adventure Photo, in case we end up going that route? Did you add onto your photography package or did you just get the one that came with your package?\n\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] Which photographer are you using? That sounds like a good rate![\/quote]No photography wasn&#039;t included at all, that was separate. I got their 8 hour package for $1600 US which included 200 pics and a photo book. I paid an extra $100 to get all the pictures.   \n\nI used Perla Brambila (her company is CeilitoLindo Photography)  from what I understand each resort has different photographers -- not sure they jump In between. That said I believe she left my resort as she has her own company,  as other brides haven&#039;t been able to use her. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1893433,"PostDate":1429205870,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 16 April 2015 - 05:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> Who was the photographer you used with Adventure Photo, in case we end up going that route? Did you add onto your photography package or did you just get the one that came with your package?<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Which photographer are you using? That sounds like a good rate!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nNo photography wasn't included at all, that was separate. I got their 8 hour package for $1600 US which included 200 pics and a photo book. I paid an extra $100 to get all the pictures.   <br><br>\nI used Perla Brambila (her company is CeilitoLindo Photography)  from what I understand each resort has different photographers -- not sure they jump In between. That said I believe she left my resort as she has her own company,  as other brides haven't been able to use her. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1441098078,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a77df20a4bc40601897ec76091bdb38d","RawContent":"@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] It may be a good idea to instead ask for their advice on their expertise in what to look for in a wedding photographer. If they then offer to be your photographer you can they offer to pay them or offer to cover their trip\/hotel. Otherwise if you ask directly they may feel obligated to say yes and not get the opportunity to enjoy your wedding as an invited guest. A friend of ours had that experience with their hairstylist friend. They asked her if she can do the bridesmaids and her hair. Initially she had said yes to later politely decline weeks before the wedding as she really preferred to enjoy the morning as a guest. It was not a great situation for them to have been in.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903905,"PostDate":1441096673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> It may be a good idea to instead ask for their advice on their expertise in what to look for in a wedding photographer. If they then offer to be your photographer you can they offer to pay them or offer to cover their trip\/hotel. Otherwise if you ask directly they may feel obligated to say yes and not get the opportunity to enjoy your wedding as an invited guest. A friend of ours had that experience with their hairstylist friend. They asked her if she can do the bridesmaids and her hair. Initially she had said yes to later politely decline weeks before the wedding as she really preferred to enjoy the morning as a guest. It was not a great situation for them to have been in.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer@rogers.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419916357,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d21fe5616bfd03668454e303a665b86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@vancouverpetunia&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Did you end up talking to your friend about doing your photos?&amp;nbsp; We also asked a friend to do ours, we agreed to pay flight and a&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;ccommodations.&amp;nbsp; After agreeing to it, she contacted us and said that her husband thinks she should be paid $500 on top of that, since technically she is working.&amp;nbsp; What was i supposed to do at that point, so we are paying it.&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903911,"PostDate":1441099220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@vancouverpetunia\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Did you end up talking to your friend about doing your photos?\u00a0 We also asked a friend to do ours, we agreed to pay flight and a<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">ccommodations.\u00a0 After agreeing to it, she contacted us and said that her husband thinks she should be paid $500 on top of that, since technically she is working.\u00a0 What was i supposed to do at that point, so we are paying it.<\/span>\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411094803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"135ed6618f6ec196a0985a581416ff8b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RivieraBride15\" post=\"1903911\" timestamp=\"1441128020\"]\n@vancouverpetunia \n\n[font=arial]Did you end up talking to your friend about doing your photos?  We also asked a friend to do ours, we agreed to pay flight and a[\/font][size=2][font=calibri][font=calibri][font=arial]ccommodations.  After agreeing to it, she contacted us and said that her husband thinks she should be paid $500 on top of that, since technically she is working.  What was i supposed to do at that point, so we are paying it.[\/font]  [\/font][\/font][\/size][\/quote]\nThat&#039;s a tough one, yes she is working BUT you are paying her flight and accommodations!  It&#039;s tough being put in that spot, but I am glad you have your photographer!","Attachments":[],"Id":1903918,"PostDate":1441101430,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RivieraBride15, on Today, 09:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@vancouverpetunia\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Did you end up talking to your friend about doing your photos?\u00a0 We also asked a friend to do ours, we agreed to pay flight and a<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">ccommodations.\u00a0 After agreeing to it, she contacted us and said that her husband thinks she should be paid $500 on top of that, since technically she is working.\u00a0 What was i supposed to do at that point, so we are paying it.<\/span>\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's a tough one, yes she is working BUT you are paying her flight and accommodations! \u00a0It's tough being put in that spot, but I am glad you have your photographer!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77507,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77a3f83df7baf4043091af6ae27bffaf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1893307\" timestamp=\"1429161326\"]\nSo, based on this thread, I&#039;m gathering that I&#039;m looking at a cost of $1000 - $5000 (I assume USD) to hire a local photographer.[\/quote]\nI know what you mean. I was quoted prices $5000 USD and beyond. For [b]Canadians you also need to keep in mind of the exchange rates[\/b]. Your $1500 USD package sounds ok, however, with your credit card&#039;s exchange rate you&#039;ll be paying around $2000 Canadian dollars or more.\n\n[b]You don&#039;t have to limit yourself to photographers in the Riviera Maya[\/b]. Search for destination photographers in your city or country. You would be surprised to find better and more affordable options. [b]For example our photographer Enrique from [url=\"http:\/\/www.decordova.ca\"]www.decordova.ca[\/url] is from Toronto but also has residence in Playa del Carmen.[\/b] My hubby from Montreal paid around $1600 Canadian and we did not have to exchange or pay for his flight. You can find fantastic deals like that if you open up your search area.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903937,"PostDate":1441107436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 15 April 2015 - 09:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<p>So, based on this thread, I'm gathering that I'm looking at a cost of $1000 - $5000 (I assume USD) to hire a local photographer.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<br><p>I know what you mean. I was quoted prices $5000 USD and beyond. For <strong>Canadians you also need to keep in mind of the exchange rates<\/strong>. Your $1500 USD package sounds ok, however, with your credit card's exchange rate you'll be paying around $2000 Canadian dollars or more.<br><br><strong>You don't have to limit yourself to photographers in the Riviera Maya<\/strong>. Search for destination photographers in your city or country. You would be surprised to find better and more affordable options. <strong>For example our photographer Enrique from\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.decordova.ca<\/a>\u00a0is\u00a0from\u00a0Toronto but also has residence in Playa del Carmen.<\/strong> My hubby from Montreal paid around $1600 Canadian and we did not have to exchange or pay for his flight. You can find fantastic deals like that if you open up your search area.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer@rogers.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419916357,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":25,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
