> User kuoling (282701)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.165.192.159","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c53ffd21431e461b10e72f388291ee9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nI will be getting married in Mexico in November and I plan on having long dresses for the bridesmaids.&amp;nbsp; They are going to be light, flowy and chiffon and magenta.&amp;nbsp; They are pretty and simple dresses.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m looking to add a pop to the dresses by having them wear a pretty hair piece or flower.&amp;nbsp; Or a cute necklace that isn&#039;t too much.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have any cool ideas?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881728,"PostDate":1420365074,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello.<\/p>\n<p>\nI will be getting married in Mexico in November and I plan on having long dresses for the bridesmaids.\u00a0 They are going to be light, flowy and chiffon and magenta.\u00a0 They are pretty and simple dresses.\u00a0 I'm looking to add a pop to the dresses by having them wear a pretty hair piece or flower.\u00a0 Or a cute necklace that isn't too much.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have any cool ideas?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yukka33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.124.145","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392451275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sarahop81","Id":276722,"Name":"Sarahop81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8644a93415289758abbb10762228c5d8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What&#039;s your other colour, or is there one? You could try to get something in that colour to contrast, or go totally out there and get something that would stand out. ETSY has a great line of bridal jewellery - you could take a look there and see what they have. There are so many sites I&#039;m sure you could find something that is reasonably priced.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881741,"PostDate":1420370565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What's your other colour, or is there one? You could try to get something in that colour to contrast, or go totally out there and get something that would stand out. ETSY has a great line of bridal jewellery - you could take a look there and see what they have. There are so many sites I'm sure you could find something that is reasonably priced.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283430199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af40d413a83befee8233208bc3fdcf68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am not sure I have a &#039;cool&#039; idea but I love the accessories I got for my bridesmaids.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They are wearing fuschia. &amp;nbsp;I am doing most of their accents in silver. &amp;nbsp;I got them silver sandals, an anklet with a few fuschia beads, and then I got them this jewelry set. &amp;nbsp; I will allow them to do whatever they want with their hair - if they want a flower or not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The pics do the piece no justice, they sparkle so beautifully. Can&#039;t wait to see them all on the girls in a couple weeks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/kim\/C16B819F-A5FB-48A1-80E1-C7FC7FB6000E_zps1pmn0n2p.jpg\" alt=\"C16B819F-A5FB-48A1-80E1-C7FC7FB6000E_zps\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/kim\/5F0D4AF8-876E-400D-A3CC-F11C01D981EE_zpsvjev0evu.png\" alt=\"5F0D4AF8-876E-400D-A3CC-F11C01D981EE_zps\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The seller is on Etsy called &#039;Dream Day Design&#039; she has A LOT of colors to choose from if you wanted something bold to contrast the magenta.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881742,"PostDate":1420370792,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am not sure I have a 'cool' idea but I love the accessories I got for my bridesmaids.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They are wearing fuschia. \u00a0I am doing most of their accents in silver. \u00a0I got them silver sandals, an anklet with a few fuschia beads, and then I got them this jewelry set. \u00a0 I will allow them to do whatever they want with their hair - if they want a flower or not.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The pics do the piece no justice, they sparkle so beautifully. Can't wait to see them all on the girls in a couple weeks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/kim\/C16B819F-A5FB-48A1-80E1-C7FC7FB6000E_zps1pmn0n2p.jpg\" alt=\"C16B819F-A5FB-48A1-80E1-C7FC7FB6000E_zps\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1194.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa365\/lskvegas\/kim\/5F0D4AF8-876E-400D-A3CC-F11C01D981EE_zpsvjev0evu.png\" alt=\"5F0D4AF8-876E-400D-A3CC-F11C01D981EE_zps\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The seller is on Etsy called 'Dream Day Design' she has A LOT of colors to choose from if you wanted something bold to contrast the magenta.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"111.93.186.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad20d93358077a0076826b2c4d42b6c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;I was found something on net &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i01.i.aliimg.com\/wsphoto\/v0\/1261253089\/Free-Shipping-Fashion-Bridal-Vintage-Lace-Flower-Hair-Jewelry-Wedding-Hair-Accessories-AHG016.jpg\" alt=\"Free-Shipping-Fashion-Bridal-Vintage-Lac\"&gt;which can be helpgul for you for bridesmaid hair style and accesory.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881946,"PostDate":1420516962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>\u00a0I was found something on net <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i01.i.aliimg.com\/wsphoto\/v0\/1261253089\/Free-Shipping-Fashion-Bridal-Vintage-Lace-Flower-Hair-Jewelry-Wedding-Hair-Accessories-AHG016.jpg\" alt=\"Free-Shipping-Fashion-Bridal-Vintage-Lac\"><\/span>which can be helpgul for you for bridesmaid hair style and accesory.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"skashish033@gmail.com","IpAddress":"111.93.186.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407203568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MillerK","Id":279306,"Name":"MillerK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.109.177.55","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f009c37e0e39d839a253cdf7f23e7011","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The above ideas are gorgeous. I really like the idea of an anklet, perhaps a floral one (saw this somewhere in my searches!) I also like small hair accessories attached with combs or pins, anthropologie often has nice hair clips and headbands. I think my bridesmaids may wear hairclips in the colour that contrasts with their dresses and matches their shoes.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882354,"PostDate":1420783769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The above ideas are gorgeous. I really like the idea of an anklet, perhaps a floral one (saw this somewhere in my searches!) I also like small hair accessories attached with combs or pins, anthropologie often has nice hair clips and headbands. I think my bridesmaids may wear hairclips in the colour that contrasts with their dresses and matches their shoes.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"drloripalooza@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.109.177.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420781510,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281652.jpg?_r=1421186719","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":296,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"drloripalooza","Id":281652,"Name":"drloripalooza","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.156.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ec3706dbe584d42c05b4b05c2cbf890","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.wallao.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/small_image\/420x\/602f0fa2c1f0d1ba5e241f914e856ff9\/4\/1\/4102hc-i.jpg\" alt=\"4102hc-i.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;or this one that can match with everything&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.wallao.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/small_image\/420x\/602f0fa2c1f0d1ba5e241f914e856ff9\/4\/0\/4071hc.jpg\" alt=\"4071hc.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;tada... so nice,, wallao pearl hair accessory&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899904,"PostDate":1436241353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.wallao.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/small_image\/420x\/602f0fa2c1f0d1ba5e241f914e856ff9\/4\/1\/4102hc-i.jpg\" alt=\"4102hc-i.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>or this one that can match with everything<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.wallao.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/small_image\/420x\/602f0fa2c1f0d1ba5e241f914e856ff9\/4\/0\/4071hc.jpg\" alt=\"4071hc.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>tada... so nice,, wallao pearl hair accessory<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430636022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77b96392a9484a8f50132a8322e2c168","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting married in Mexico in October :)&amp;nbsp; I bought these rhinestone starfish clips for myself to wear, and it maybe cute for your girls.&amp;nbsp; I found them on &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.haircomesthebride.com\/rhinestone-starfish-hair-clip-sea-star\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.haircomesthebride.com\/rhinestone-starfish-hair-clip-sea-star\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899906,"PostDate":1436245011,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married in Mexico in October <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I bought these rhinestone starfish clips for myself to wear, and it maybe cute for your girls.\u00a0 I found them on <a href='http:\/\/www.haircomesthebride.com\/rhinestone-starfish-hair-clip-sea-star\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.haircomes...-clip-sea-star\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erind285@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411094803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RivieraBride15","Id":279902,"Name":"RivieraBride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dbf7bcce1f66371b06c3b622660eaae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! &amp;nbsp;I just got married a few weeks ago! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My bridesmaids wore coral and I decided that since it was a beach wedding the perfect hair accessory for them would be flower crowns. &amp;nbsp;They loved them and it added extra colour and beauty to the look and to the photos. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am a jewellery designer and had made them necklaces and earrings but found that when we put it all together it was TOO much so we stuck to simple earrings and the flower crown was the statement piece. &amp;nbsp;When else do you get to wear a fun flower crown !! ? hahaha&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;good luck! :)\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(Flower crowns from Aldo $10 each)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Sarahop81\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899919,"PostDate":1436253216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! \u00a0I just got married a few weeks ago! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My bridesmaids wore coral and I decided that since it was a beach wedding the perfect hair accessory for them would be flower crowns. \u00a0They loved them and it added extra colour and beauty to the look and to the photos. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a jewellery designer and had made them necklaces and earrings but found that when we put it all together it was TOO much so we stuck to simple earrings and the flower crown was the statement piece. \u00a0When else do you get to wear a fun flower crown !! ? hahaha\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>good luck! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899919]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-277519-0-39078300-1436281822.jpg\" title=\"IMG_4495.JPG -  204.49KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-277519-0-39078300-1436281822.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_4495.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899919]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-277519-0-50116800-1436281831.jpg\" title=\"IMG_4496.JPG -  138.47KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-277519-0-50116800-1436281831.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_4496.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>(Flower crowns from Aldo $10 each)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276722\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276722-sarahop81\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sarahop81<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396954052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46f0b9b6ce4c319bc34bd98c01f7c253","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hi Girls,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;On our expiriencie a Natural Flower as accessories for the hair looks lovely, organic &amp;amp; natural..&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;This concept &amp;nbsp;goes on beach wedding or a destination wedding !!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81568]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Adventure Weddings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Toll Free 1 866.731.81.52&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Puerto Vallarta. Mexico&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900003,"PostDate":1436344775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Hi Girls,<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">On our expiriencie a Natural Flower as accessories for the hair looks lovely, organic & natural..<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">This concept \u00a0goes on beach wedding or a destination wedding !!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81568-hair-accessories\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_235575.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='hair accessories'  width='200' height='200'  alt='hair accessories' id='sml_image_view_81568' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Adventure Weddings<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Toll Free 1 866.731.81.52<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Puerto Vallarta. Mexico<\/span><\/span><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343030003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.76.78.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78536,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21cb83c0ce8403f439e43c75f676879f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great ideas!&amp;nbsp; Thank you everyone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900036,"PostDate":1436355320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great ideas!\u00a0 Thank you everyone.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yukka33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.173.124.145","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392451275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/pro