,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"893ab52905fb2c6e0f0ae512f61e445f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Xarocas[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m thinking of having a look on Groupon or something like that for bracelet offers.... ideally I would love a bracelet where I can get their name engraved and our wedding quote: each journey begins with a single step...&#039; \n \n Which ebay sellers can you recommend?[\/quote] \n What a great idea to have a wedding quote! Now I&#039;m furiously looking up ones online - any suggestions where I can look?","Attachments":[],"Id":1792916,"PostDate":1376894071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Xarocas<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm thinking of having a look on Groupon or something like that for bracelet offers.... ideally I would love a bracelet where I can get their name engraved and our wedding quote: each journey begins with a single step...'<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Which ebay sellers can you recommend?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> What a great idea to have a wedding quote! Now I'm furiously looking up ones online - any suggestions where I can look?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"landry.janelle3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.176.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365163299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268229.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Janelle0308","Id":268229,"Name":"Janelle0308","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d8ffa2ececa634802e24c118825ab98","RawContent":"I had a look on pinterest... Just type in wedding quotes or love quotes.... I went to a wedding where they had it and it really helped to bring the theme together for everyone! Let us know what you find!:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1793340,"PostDate":1377004724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had a look on pinterest... Just type in wedding quotes or love quotes.... I went to a wedding where they had it and it really helped to bring the theme together for everyone! Let us know what you find!<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xarocas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.24.83.173","GroupId":40,"GroupN