alse,"PostKey":"ac3da4e7a48f9ed40882914d74bb1e9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Girls tend to like the silk robes to wear the day of the wedding&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794036,"PostDate":1377241181,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Girls tend to like the silk robes to wear the day of the wedding<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"myyooths@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.121.146.249","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376485630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272589.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"myyooths","Id":272589,"Name":"myyooths","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"380ab7a37b4fafe39c6a2a494513232f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m very lost for gifts to give my wedding godparents.... in Portugal the tradition is that the bride picks a set of godparents and the groom picks another set. My godparents are going to be my sister and a very close friend. I wanted to get them something small when I actually aske them (in october)... something that they could keep and maybe take\/use during the day? I though of a tie for him, but no idea what the equivelent could be for my sister? Any other ideas?? Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1794841,"PostDate":1377508340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm very lost for gifts to give my wedding godparents.... in Portugal the tradition is that the bride picks a set of godparents and the groom picks another set. My godparents are going to be my sister and a very close friend. I wanted to get them something small when I actually aske them (in october)... something that they could keep and maybe take\/use during the day? I though of a tie for him, but no idea what the equivelent could be for my sister? Any other ideas?? Thanks<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xarocas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.24.83.173","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376012791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272399.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Xarocas","Id":272399,"Name":"Xarocas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e8adf32a30fce016aefbe116b1a2473","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Janelle0308[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n What a great idea to have a wedding quote! Now I&#039;m furiously looking up ones online - any suggestions where I can look?[\/quote] \n \n Try Etsy as well and type in Quotes! I have a wall decal I want to get for my bedroom but maybe I can use it as my wedding quote: \n \n \"So I can Kiss you Anytime I want\" \n \n Ladies: What do you think? should it be cuter? lol lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1795255,"PostDate":1377603885,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Janelle0308<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> What a great idea to have a wedding quote! Now I'm furiously looking up ones online - any suggestions where I can look?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Try Etsy as well and type in Quotes! I have a wall decal I want to get for my bedroom but maybe I can use it as my wedding quote:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \"So I can Kiss you Anytime I want\"<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ladies: What do you think? should it be cuter? lol lol\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geodestiny@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.86.43.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364201195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267773.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SoonMrsD","Id":267773,"Name":"SoonMrsD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1880c8d1a2e724f0afab45faaa021694","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]SoonMrsD[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Try Etsy as well and type in Quotes! I have a wall decal I want to get for my bedroom but maybe I can use it as my wedding quote: \n \n \"So I can Kiss you Anytime I want\" \n \n Ladies: What do you think? should it be cuter? lol lol[\/quote] \n So cute! \n From Sweet Home Alabama, right? And it is the answer given to the question, \"Why do you want to marry me, anyhow?\" \n \n How absolutely perfect!","Attachments":[],"Id":1795357,"PostDate":1377627485,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>SoonMrsD<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Try Etsy as well and type in Quotes! I have a wall decal I want to get for my bedroom but maybe I can use it as my wedding quote:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \"So I can Kiss you Anytime I want\"<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ladies: What do you think? should it be cuter? lol lol\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> So cute!<\/p> <p> From Sweet Home Alabama, right? And it is the answer given to the question, \"Why do you want to marry me, anyhow?\"<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How absolutely perfect!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krys85418@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.124.120","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1301844912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peach","Id":238489,"Name":"Peach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22d6e41e16c05708b56672c94616c69e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Peach[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n So cute! \n From Sweet Home Alabama, right? And it is the answer given to the question, \"Why do you want to marry me, anyhow?\" \n \n How absolutely perfect![\/quote] \n \n Yes exactly haha .... ok I wasn&#039;t sure if it was sweet enough but thank you for your input!","Attachments":[],"Id":1795442,"PostDate":1377667056,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Peach<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> So cute!<\/p> <p> From Sweet Home Alabama, right? And it is the answer given to the question, \"Why do you want to marry me, anyhow?\"<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How absolutely perfect!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes exactly haha .... ok I wasn't sure if it was sweet enough but thank you for your input!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geodestiny@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.86.43.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364201195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267773.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SoonMrsD","Id":267773,"Name":"SoonMrsD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"314c4d63afc9b47c1eae2b91172c690c","RawContent":"I think thats really cute quote and perfect for your wedding day!:) have you found any you like Janelle?","Attachments":[],"Id":1796634,"PostDate":1378046161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think thats really cute quote and perfect for your wedding day!<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> have you found any you like Janelle?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"xarocas@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.24.83.173","GroupId