{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.52.97.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59a91fab619ef53b45b0b5bbeccb817a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I paid for the 4 bridesmaids dresses. (they will have to pay for their own alterations). The dresses&amp;nbsp;cost about 210 each.&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m also paying for their makeup. We have a great makeup artist traveling to our hotel for the day. They will be responsible for their own hair and can get it done at the hotel Spa.&amp;nbsp;In a&amp;nbsp;canvas tote bag with&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;palm tree and a little initial i am putting together a gift bag as well.&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp; bought JCrew necklaces for each of them. (i think they were like 98 bucks each but I got the employee discount so they were prob closer to 60 or 70 each.) They can wear these with their dresses. I also bought lounge chair beach towels with their names on them too. I like these because they won&#039;t fall off their chair like regular beach towels and will be really long. I also made hangers with the names and dates on them to hang their dresses on. (using vinyl decals). I am thinking to get something else for their tote bags...thinking something&amp;nbsp;like flip flops&amp;nbsp;not sure yet. Plus I want to get my MOH something extra and nice.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844001,"PostDate":1397240340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I paid for the 4 bridesmaids dresses. (they will have to pay for their own alterations). The dresses\u00a0cost about 210 each.\u00a0I'm also paying for their makeup. We have a great makeup artist traveling to our hotel for the day. They will be responsible for their own hair and can get it done at the hotel Spa.\u00a0In a\u00a0canvas tote bag with\u00a0a\u00a0palm tree and a little initial i am putting together a gift bag as well.\u00a0I\u00a0 bought JCrew necklaces for each of them. (i think they were like 98 bucks each but I got the employee discount so they were prob closer to 60 or 70 each.) They can wear these with their dresses. I also bought lounge chair beach towels with their names on them too. I like these because they won't fall off their chair like regular beach towels and will be really long. I also made hangers with the names and dates on them to hang their dresses on. (using vinyl decals). I am thinking to get something else for their tote bags...thinking something\u00a0like flip flops\u00a0not sure yet. Plus I want to get my MOH something extra and nice.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dana.bonuomo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.81.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392028077,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276608.jpg?_r=1399217554","PhotoWidth":64,"PhotoHeight":148,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MontegoBayBridePA","Id":276608,"Name":"MontegoBayBridePA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.45.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"530abd154b7eb41a3199e20073a7fdba","RawContent":"I am doing custom made clutches (which they are using in lieu of flowers at the ceremony), silk robes for the wedding morning, the custom hanger for their dress, along with their hair\/makeup and wedding day jewelry. I will also pay for their dresses. For the guys, my FI will be buying their ties, and buying them watches.","Attachments":[],"Id":1844025,"PostDate":1397285515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am doing custom made clutches (which they are using in lieu of flowers at the ceremony), silk robes for the wedding morning, the custom hanger for their dress, along with their hair\/makeup and wedding day jewelry. I will also pay for their dresses. For the guys, my FI will be buying their ties, and buying them watches. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390227808,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e13a1659528dbfa0a97490e75ef6d34c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1844025\" timestamp=\"1397314315\"]\nI am doing custom made clutches (which they are using in lieu of flowers at the ceremony), silk robes for the wedding morning, the custom hanger for their dress, along with their hair\/makeup and wedding day jewelry. I will also pay for their dresses. For the guys, my FI will be buying their ties, and buying them watches.[\/quote]Oh wow!  I like the idea of custom made clutches.  \n\nI found these cute little emergency kits for bridesmaids [url=\"http:\/\/buff.ly\/1JB8eV5\"]HERE[\/url]\n\nI will try to upload a picture when I get home later...","Attachments":[],"Id":1884320,"PostDate":1422351235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 12 April 2014 - 06:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am doing custom made clutches (which they are using in lieu of flowers at the ceremony), silk robes for the wedding morning, the custom hanger for their dress, along with their hair\/makeup and wedding day jewelry. I will also pay for their dresses. For the guys, my FI will be buying their ties, and buying them watches.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh wow! \u00a0I like the idea of custom made clutches. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found these cute little emergency kits for bridesmaids <a href='http:\/\/buff.ly\/1JB8eV5' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>HERE<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will try to upload a picture when I get home later...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393510130,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.124.26.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1435914191,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52453529aa496e4c3671fddb567a4bf6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LovesJakeyPoo\" post=\"1479624\" timestamp=\"1309534000\"]\nSo I haven&#039;t found a recent post on this! What is everyone getting for their bridesmaids and Maid of Honor?[\/quote]\nHey everyone!\n\nSome really great ideas! Thought you brides-to-be might like to hear about our unique bridesmaids gift! :)\n\nMy co-founder and I have created a collection of [url=\"http:\/\/www.naymeinc.com\"]unique, personalized necklaces[\/url] designed to represent the meaning of names. It&#039;s an easy, yet thoughtful gift that carries a lot of meaning. Simply search their names [url=\"http:\/\/www.naymeinc.com\/search\"]here[\/url] to find an elegant sterling silver pendant, personalized just for them.\n \nBecause our necklaces all have the same look and feel, they accessorize any bridesmaids dress perfectly (we&#039;ve had many wear them the day of!). Here&#039;s a pic to show you what they look like on!:\n\n[img]https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0189\/3670\/files\/bridesmaids-page-1_0c999b14-3f1d-4368-aedc-36ed3cc848cb_1024x1024.jpg?27159[\/img]\n\nAll necklaces are packaged in a little black box which details their name, its meaning, origin and what we have designed to represent their name. An extra touch that really says a personal thank you!\n\n[img]https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0189\/3670\/files\/behindthescenesboxes_grande.jpg?7576[\/img]\n\nHave a look at our webiste. If you do not find your bridesmaids names, [email=\"louise@nayme.ca?subject=Bridesmaids%20Gift\"]email me[\/email] and I will gladly help you out! We also give discounts for brides, so keep that in mind ;)\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)]\n[background=rgb(255,255,255)]\nWarm regards,\nLouise @ Nayme Inc.\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.naymeinc.com\"]www.naymeinc.com[\/url]\nInstagram\/Twitter: @naymeinc[\/background][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1899750,"PostDate":1435913582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LovesJakeyPoo, on 01 July 2011 - 07:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I haven't found a recent post on this! What is everyone getting for their bridesmaids and Maid of Honor?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey everyone!<br><br>\nSome really great ideas! Thought you brides-to-be might like to hear about our unique bridesmaids gift! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My co-founder and I have created a collection of <a href='http:\/\/www.naymeinc.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>unique, personalized necklaces<\/a> designed to represent the meaning of names. It's an easy, yet thoughtful gift that carries a lot of meaning. Simply search their names <a href='http:\/\/www.naymeinc.com\/search' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a> to find an elegant sterling silver pendant, personalized just for them.<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Because our necklaces all have the same look and feel, they accessorize any bridesmaids dress perfectly (we've had many wear them the day of!). Here's a pic to show you what they look like on!:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0189\/3670\/files\/bridesmaids-page-1_0c999b14-3f1d-4368-aedc-36ed3cc848cb_1024x1024.jpg?27159\" alt=\"bridesmaids-page-1_0c999b14-3f1d-4368-ae\"><\/span><br><br>\nAll necklaces are packaged in a little black box which details their name, its meaning, origin and what we have designed to represent their name. An extra touch that really says a personal thank you!<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0189\/3670\/files\/behindthescenesboxes_grande.jpg?7576\" alt=\"behindthescenesboxes_grande.jpg?7576\"><\/span><br><br>\nHave a look at our webiste. If you do not find your bridesmaids names, <a href='mailto:louise@nayme.ca?subject=Bridesmaids%20Gift' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>email me<\/a> and I will gladly help you out! We also give discounts for brides, so keep that in mind <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-align:left\"><br>\nWarm regards,<br>\nLouise @ Nayme Inc.<br><a href='http:\/\/www.naymeinc.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.naymeinc.com<\/a><br>\nInstagram\/Twitter: @naymeinc<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"naymeteam@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.124.26.244","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435910619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283799.jpg?_r=1435939875","PhotoWidth":140,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"naymeinc","Id":283799,"Name":"naymeinc","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":74,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
